// HiFi-GAN Weight Memory - Example Format
// Format: One 16-bit hex value per line (Q2.14 fixed-point)
// Organization: Flattened [layer][ch_out][ch_in][kernel_pos]
//
// Example calculation for PostNet Layer 0:
// - Input channels: 1, Output channels: 32, Kernel size: 5
// - Total weights for layer 0: 1 * 32 * 5 = 160 weights
// - Address range: 0x0000 to 0x009F
//
// PostNet Layer 1-3: 32 * 32 * 5 = 5120 weights each
// PostNet Layer 4: 32 * 1 * 5 = 160 weights
//
// Sample weights below (initialized to small random values)

// Layer 0, Channel 0, Kernel weights (5 values)
0100  // 0.0625 in Q2.14
00C0  // 0.0469
0080  // 0.0313
0040  // 0.0156
0020  // 0.0078

// Layer 0, Channel 1, Kernel weights
0110
00D0
0090
0050
0030

// Layer 0, Channel 2-31 (abbreviated for example)
0105
00C5
0085
0045
0025

// ... Continue pattern for remaining channels and layers ...
// For actual use, generate with Python/MATLAB script

// Fill remaining with zeros for simulation
@00A0
0000
